# Gate 95: raw payload store bodies never enter git.
# `artifacts/` is not ignored wholesale — a dozen artifact directories are
# committed deliberately — so the payload store would otherwise be one
# `git add artifacts/...` away from putting agency response bodies, and any
# credentials inside them, into history. That is the Gate 89 JWT finding with a
# new directory name. The readiness artifacts live in a separate, committed
# directory: artifacts/raw_payload_store_readiness/.
artifacts/raw_payload_store/
